====================
Week 6 Assignment 1
====================
Description    : train and predict classifiers in combination with filtered dataframes
   Data filter : only datasets from tiers AOD, AODSIM, MINIAOD, MINIAODSIM, USER
   Subtask 1   : train on full data, predict on full data
   Subtask 2   : train on full data, predict on filtered data 
   Subtask 3   : train on filtered data, predict on filtered data
Train period   : old, new 2015.01.01-2015.12.31
Valid period   : old, new 2016.01.01-2016.01.20
Log            : no
AdaBoost params: learning_rate=2, n_estimators=200
